<figure id="S5.T5" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:80%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table V: </span>WER (%) and % of transcriptions in the correct language (% Lang) for SALMONN, Qwen2-Audio, and Phi-4-Multimodal-Instruct.</figcaption>
<table id="S5.T5.3" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="S5.T5.3.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S5.T5.3.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.45pt 3.0pt;"><span id="S5.T5.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">Language</span></td>
